# === KICAD ===

# Lock Files
**/hardware/*.000
**/hardware/*.bak
**/hardware/*.bck
**/hardware/*.kicad_pcb-bak
**/hardware/*.kicad_sch-bak
**/hardware/*-backups
**/hardware/*-cache*
**/hardware/*-bak
**/hardware/*-bak*
**/hardware/*~
**/hardware/~*
**/hardware/_autosave-*
**/hardware/\#auto_saved_files\#
**/hardware/*.tmp
**/hardware/*-save.pro
**/hardware/*-save.kicad_pcb
**/hardware/fp-info-cache
**/hardware/~*.lck
**/hardware/\#auto_saved_files#

# Netlist files (exported from Eeschema)
**/hardware/*.net

# Autorouter files (exported from Pcbnew)
**/hardware/*.dsn
**/hardware/*.ses

# Exported BOM files
**/hardware/*.xml
**/hardware/*.csv

# Archived Backups (KiCad 6.0)
**/hardware/**/*-backups/*.zip

# Local git-based history (KiCad 9.0+)
**/hardware/.history

# Local project settings
**/hardware/*.kicad_prl

# Generated Production Files
**/hardware/*.drl
**/hardware/*.grbjob
**/hardware/*.grb
